# Subscrip Core

Read these shared instructions before substantial work:

- `.agents/project-context.md`
- `.agents/engineering-standards.md`
- `.agents/v1-scope.md`
- `.agents/agent-playbook.md`

Key rules:

- Keep v1 scope focused on reliable auth, subscriptions, finance planner, dashboard, settings, setup and quality gates.
- Never trust client-provided `userId`; derive it from the server session.
- Do not edit `.env` or expose secrets.
- Prefer existing local patterns before adding dependencies.
- Validate changed TS/TSX with lint and typecheck where practical.
